00:35:13.040 --> 00:35:14.060
Siya

00:35:16.630 --> 00:35:18.500
may gusto sayo.

00:35:24.630 --> 00:35:25.610
Pumasok ka, ginoo.

00:35:31.520 --> 00:35:32.250
sasama ako!

00:35:33.670 --> 00:35:34.650
Halika sa loob.

00:35:49.750 --> 00:35:50.820
Paano ako makakatulong, ginoo?

00:35:51.150 --> 00:35:52.210
Summer na ngayon.

00:35:52.590 --> 00:35:54.060
Dapat mayroon kang sariwang pufferfish.

00:35:54.630 --> 00:35:56.540
Kami ay isang grupo ng 30-something na manlalakbay.

00:35:56.920 --> 00:35:59.610
Isang nilagang pufferfish na may mga rushes para sa lahat, pakiusap.

