00:39:41.190 --> 00:39:42.380
Kanta Lanxi

00:39:42.510 --> 00:39:46.130
ay estudyante ni Li Chengtian pagkatapos niyang magretiro.

00:39:46.630 --> 00:39:48.090
Hindi alam ng marami iyon.

00:39:49.110 --> 00:39:51.940
Kahit kailan ko lang nalaman.

00:39:52.610 --> 00:39:54.570
Muli, Kamahalan

00:39:56.670 --> 00:39:58.170
